  "body": "Systematic scan and optimization of every major console interface for WCAG 2.1 AA compliance, design token usage, spacing consistency, and Shadcn component alignment.\n\n### Accessibility\n\n- Added `role=\"link\"`, `tabIndex={0}`, `onKeyDown` (Enter/Space) to all clickable `Card` components — previously mouse-only\n- Added `aria-label`, `aria-pressed` to AppCard favorite toggle; `focus-visible:opacity-100` so keyboard users can discover it\n- Added `role=\"status\"` + `aria-live=\"polite\"` to all loading/saving spinners (SystemHubPage, MetadataManagerPage, MetadataDetailPage)\n- Added `role=\"toolbar\"` + `aria-label` to DashboardView widget toolbar buttons with `focus-visible:ring-2`\n- Added sr-only `<label>` to search inputs in MetadataManagerPage, AppManagementPage, SearchResultsPage\n- Added `aria-label` to all 5 action buttons per row in AppManagementPage\n- Added `role=\"img\"`, `aria-label`, `<title>` to AuthPageLayout SVG logo\n- Added `aria-label` to MetadataGrid `<table>`, title tooltips on truncated cells\n- Added `aria-required` to MetadataFormDialog native `<select>` with proper focus ring styling\n\n### Design tokens & Shadcn alignment\n\n- Replaced hardcoded `bg-blue-50 text-blue-700` badge in AppCard with `<Badge variant=\"secondary\">`\n- Replaced raw `<input type=\"checkbox\">` in AppManagementPage with Shadcn `<Checkbox>` (2 instances)\n\n### Spacing & layout\n\n- Standardized HomePage padding to `px-4 sm:px-6` (was fixed `px-6`)\n- Unified RecentApps/StarredApps grid to `xl:grid-cols-4` (StarredApps was `lg:grid-cols-4`, RecentApps was `lg:grid-cols-3`)\n- Standardized MetadataManagerPage card grid from `gap-3` → `gap-4`\n- DashboardView content area: `p-0 sm:p-6` → `p-2 sm:p-4 md:p-6` (graduated scale)\n\n### Code quality\n\n- Extracted `capitalizeFirst()` to `utils.ts` — replaces duplicated inline logic and CSS `capitalize` (not i18n-safe)\n\n```ts\n// Before (in both RecentApps.tsx and StarredApps.tsx)\n<p className=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground capitalize\">{item.type}</p>\n\n// After\nimport { capitalizeFirst } from '../../utils';\n<p className=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">{capitalizeFirst(item.type)}</p>\n```\n\nAll 893 existing tests pass. No test modifications."
